
# Train Booking and Reservation System

## Project Description

The Train Booking and Reservation System is a DBMS-based
project developed using C++ and MySQL.

The main objective of this project is to manage railway
reservation operations in a simple and efficient way.

It allows users to search for trains, check seat availability,
book tickets, cancel reservations, and view booking details.

MySQL is used to store and manage train, passenger, and
reservation information.

## Features

- View all available trains.
- Search trains by source and destination.
- Book train tickets.
- Check seat availability.
- Generate unique booking IDs.
- Cancel train reservations.
- View passenger booking details.
- Update seat availability automatically.
- Store information permanently in MySQL.

## Technologies Used

