## Database Tables

### 1. Trains

Stores train information.

- train_id (Primary Key)
- train_name
- source
- destination
- total_seats
- available_seats

### 2. Passengers

Stores passenger information.

- passenger_id (Primary Key)
- name
- age
- gender

### 3. Reservations

Stores booking information.

- booking_id (Primary Key)
- passenger_id (Foreign Key)
- train_id (Foreign Key)
- journey_date
- seats_booked
- status

